Appendable BYTEA Toaster

I. The Pluggable TOAST

On Pluggable TOAST please check contrib/toastapi/README.toastapi

The Appendable BYTEA Toaster is a part of a Pluggable TOAST extension
pack for PostgreSQL. Appendable BYTEA Toaster is a Toaster for BYTEA
data type with implemented APPEND opration ('||'). Modified Toaster
stores tail of the TOASTed BYTEA value inline inside Toast Pointer,
and uses it in APPEND. The UPDATE and APPEND operations instead of
default TOAST mechanics actually update stored value, without
invalidating existing and creating a new one.

Note:
BYTEA Toaster modifies PostgreSQL core to alter byteacat function
to introduce new implemetation of APPEND for BYTEA.

II. Installation

BYTEA Toaster requires TOAST API (toastapi extension) to be installed.